{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24088","headline":"西行 · 白居易","name":"西行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衣裘不单薄，车马不羸弱。\n蔼蔼三月天，闲行亦不恶。\n寿安流水馆，硖石青山郭。\n官道柳阴阴，行宫花漠漠。\n常闻俗间语，有钱在处乐。\n我虽非富人，亦不苦寂寞。\n家僮解弦管，骑从携桮杓。\n时向春风前，歇鞍开一酌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}